{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 Nominated for multiple VR Game of the Year awards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Floor Plan 2</strong> is a comedy adventure inspired by escape rooms, packed with more puzzles than you can fit in an elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your first day of work, the boss sends you to find a lost treasure that will turn the company's fortunes around. And good news: it's somewhere in the building! Just use the elevator down the hall. By the way, each floor is a gateway to another world, nobody speaks your language, and time and space are fluid. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/38982492_845897397659584_3631216536857088708_n_1.gif?t=1743532778\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HILARIOUS, MIND-BENDING PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your elevator to explore a series of interconnected escape rooms. Step out onto each floor, meet bizarre characters, and unravel their secrets. Revisit completed floors to find new, remixed challenges waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/39035433_1038816711125368_3027192623016756224_n.gif?t=1743532778\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HAND PRESENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find Red Harrys, lost critters hidden throughout the building, to earn hand presents and transform your hands in all sorts of unexpected ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/38974524_1056259055909744_8279647510578223567_n.gif?t=1743532778\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">6+ HOURS OF HANDCRAFTED GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filled with critically-acclaimed puzzles and memorable &quot;aha!&quot; moments that respect your time and intelligence. Now includes the Backside Story expansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/38982692_1245115070004270_6975097979111393659_n.gif?t=1743532778\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARMING-AS-HECK WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built for VR, comfortable for everyone, and developed with love by the small but mighty Turbo Button team.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Shift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/8abbb33f600f45a8e5d72660748c3268f92c12c7.jpg"},{"name":"Handy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/ea9e1e712e85f8ae5785f3bd981b73165780c058.jpg"},{"name":"Handier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/b3b072cd8656cf6e6bd8ee00536a768117eece83.jpg"},{"name":"Handiest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/4d059e6bf0d967fc7b699e52d0d0dcb023a41a7d.jpg"},{"name":"Party Fowl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/5b907939a1a3a0a021ceb18c7d883f260902d663.jpg"},{"name":"Clap Clap!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/ef0ac6d6732c3be9b0b7180c9de9716315dc0d0e.jpg"},{"name":"Clap Clap?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/e50286c9cbc98c12df0050c93012187743f870bf.jpg"},{"name":"You Can Pet The Frog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/cdeb4e736e8a72677fb4118ef9452bbc0a42a228.jpg"},{"name":"Bowl Movement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/75944fe13088df4a077e77fbdfb05e364af4f339.jpg"},{"name":"Full Class","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1534850/ea3061128cb68f7b7f467d89c02a236da2cbcf7d.jpg"}],"total":21},